@startuml
title Notification Entity Model

class Notification {
  **Primary Key**
  --
  + ID : ObjectID
  --
  **Content**
  --
  + Title : string
  + NotificationBody : string
  + NotificationType : string
  + NotificationParts : any
  --
  **Targeting**
  --
  + IsPublic : bool
  + For : constants.NotificationFor
  --
  **Status**
  --
  + Status : constants.NotificationStatus
  + Seen : bool
  + Enabled : bool
  + IsDeleted : bool
  --
  **Metadata**
  --
  + CreatedBy : string
  + CreatedAt : time.Time
  + LastModified : time.Time
  + DeletedAt : time.Time
}

note right of Notification::For
  Target audience (e.g., All, Specific User)
end note

note bottom of Notification
  **Field Descriptions:**
  **NotificationType**: Type (e.g., Info, Alert)
  **IsPublic**: Visible to all users?
end note
@enduml
